title: Workers' Militia
card-image: img/cards/reichsbanner.svg
subtitle: Arm the workers to defend our meetings and the revolution.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: reichsbanner_timer <= 0 and legality >= 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer = 5

[? if bol_regime = 0 : The Red Guard is Bolshevik, and the army is uncertain. The Right talks of order. A workers' militia answering to the Soviet is a weapon that the party can use without waiting for orders. ?][? if bol_regime = 1 : Arming workers against the Bolshevik state would be an act of civil war. Arming them against the Whites is another matter. ?]

- @organise: Organise militias in the factories. (1 resource)
- @train: Drill the militia and place them under the Soviet.
- @against_whites: Raise militias to defend the cities against the Whites.
- @talk: Talk it over with the factory committees.
- @easy_discard

@talk
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 1);
!}

The factory committees listened, argued and promised to think about it. Nothing was armed, but the idea has been planted.

@organise
choose-if: resources >= 1 and bol_regime = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 1 : We have no resources. ?][? if bol_regime = 1 : Not under the Bolshevik state. ?]
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
Q.militia = (Q.militia || 0) + 2;
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2});
RO.add(Q, {right_threat: -2, bolshevik: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

The factories in Petrograd and Moscow have armed detachments again. They answer to the Soviet executive, and, we hope, to nobody else.

@train
choose-if: bol_regime = 0 and militia >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no militia yet.
on-arrival: {!
Q.militia += 1;
RO.add(Q, {right_threat: -2, soviet_democracy: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, 0);
!}

Drill is dull. It also makes the difference between an armed crowd and a force.

@against_whites
view-if: bol_regime = 1
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 4});
Q.red_army += 3;
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 3, soviet_democracy: -1, repression: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
!}

Whatever our quarrel with the Bolsheviks, the Whites in power would mean the end of every labour organisation. Our workers drill for the defence of the city, not for the defence of the regime.
